Common Type StaffIdentificationCode
    documentation 'A coding scheme that is used for identification and record-keeping purposes by 
    'schools, social services or other agencies to refer to a staff member.
    shared string IdentificationCode named IdentificationCode
        documentation 'A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to a staff member by a school, 
        'school system, a state, or other agency or entity.
        is required
    descriptor StaffIdentificationSystem
        documentation 'A coding scheme that is used for identification and record-keeping purposes by 
        'schools, social services, or other agencies to refer to a staff member.
        is part of identity
    shared string IdentificationCode named IdentificationCode
        documentation 'The organization code or name assigning the staff Identification Code.
        is optional
        with context AssigningOrganization
